  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SP - Farm Africa Tanzania Horticultural - strategic partnership (B-list)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s goal is to contribute to poverty reduction and employment creation in Tanzania through improving the framework conditions for private sector development in horticulture value chains. This will be achieved through a series of activities in support of the project&#x2019;s anticipated overall outcome of increasing the number of Tanzanian agribusiness SMEs working with smallholder farmers through improved business management skills, access to finance and market linkages in the horticulture se</narrative>
  </description>
